	(text "Motor supply and dual H-bridge (D5, U1)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 16.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0fb873d6-ca1a-5df9-a7c6-2412b0a7518f")
	)
	(text "D5 keeps motor back-EMF off SYS_5V. C4 (47 µF,\nlow ESR) buffers VM_MOTOR; D6 clamps transients.\nC5 is the U1 VM bypass."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 100.33 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8e3ed9b2-5a68-5dc3-82d8-fb1edd92a495")
	)
	(text "R35/R36 set ITRIP = VTRIP / 0.82 Ω =\n0.22-0.28 A per bridge, with Kelvin\nreturns to the U1 GND pad."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 167.64 100.33 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d9ef4e7b-903d-589d-8799-68045c91ac9a")
	)
	(text "Pin 2 (+) of J2/J3 is OUT_MOT_LP/RP,\ndriven from MOTOR_LP/RP; host software\nsets the drive direction."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220.98 100.33 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7a65f584-55fb-5729-a919-f6bd73c514ca")
	)
	(text "SYS_5V supervisor (U11) and SAFE_3V3 bypass (C21)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1e358a0a-c6e4-512b-986e-c9117eeaa041")
	)
	(text "U11 pulls MOTOR_FAULT low while SYS_5V is\nbelow 4.65 V and releases it 12-28 ms after\nrecovery (CT open). R19 is the fault-bus\npull-up. C21 is the U12 VDD bypass and sits\nat U12. U12 and C33, the U11 VDD bypass, are\non sheet 4 (Independent safety supervisor)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.38 123.19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a45f1598-bb6c-5f82-9134-3736a9317a0d")
	)
	(text "READY status to host (R20)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 178.27 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b9add6c9-636a-541f-b0f7-901304a0767a")
	)
	(text "R20 passes READY from status buffer U28 to host\nGPIO20, header pin 38. U28 runs from the host\n3.3 V rail; RN6 pulls HOST_FAULT low. U28 and RN6\nare on sheet 4 (Independent safety supervisor).\nHIGH = healthy (READY); LOW = fault, or the\nsafety domain is unpowered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 179.54 138.43 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fc3fd3fd-0450-5d9d-80fc-b610e4904fae")
	)
	(text "Notes"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "07017da2-3309-5372-b364-b5ccc2e3f8f9")
	)
	(text "1. U1 sleeps (nSLEEP low) unless gate U14 on sheet 4 (Independent safety supervisor) asserts MOTOR_EN_SAFE;\n   sleep is the power-up default.\n2. U1 nFAULT (pin 8) is left open: on the fault bus it would hold its own nSLEEP low through U14.\n   U1 still protects itself (overcurrent retry, thermal shutdown, UVLO).\n3. C36/C37 on U1 pins 11/14 (NC on DRV8411) provide VCP/VINT for the pin-compatible DRV8833PWPR."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 171.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "257144ec-ae8b-5c48-9f5d-f091acea144b")
	)
