		(property "Source" "Selected manufacturer datasheets"
			(at 121.92 63.5 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Design_note" "DRV8411 with ISEN shunts R35/R36 0.82 ohm (VTRIP 180-230 mV -> ITRIP 0.22-0.28 A per bridge) and nSLEEP = MOTOR_EN_SAFE (hardware AND U14 of MOTOR_EN, fault bus and MCU permit). nFAULT (pin 8) is not connected: on the fault bus it would gate its own nSLEEP through U14 and hold the bridges in a wake/fault loop. U1 still protects itself (OCP auto-retry, TSD, UVLO). Pins 11/14 are NC on DRV8411; C36/C37 there make DRV8833PWPR (VCP/VINT) a drop-in alternate. Bridge B = left motor (BIN1 LN -> BOUT1 OUT_MOT_LN, BIN2 LP -> BOUT2 OUT_MOT_LP), bridge A = right motor (AIN1 RP -> AOUT1 OUT_MOT_RP, AIN2 RN -> AOUT2 OUT_MOT_RN)."
			(at 121.92 63.5 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
