				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Design_note" "Effective capacitance and rated voltage are assembly requirements; place close to supported pins. The fitted voltage rating meets or exceeds the required minimum. Effective capacitance under bias, temperature and aging remains a separate acceptance requirement. Layout: 0201 placed directly under U1 pin 12 (VM) / pin 13 (GND) with its GND pad strapped straight to pin 13 - minimum decoupling loop; VM_MOTOR <= 5.5 V so the 25 V X5R part keeps ample margin (bulk C4 carries the energy; C5 is the HF bypass)."
			(at 99.06 35.56 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
